      "side": 1,
      "message": "Something like this would make it easier to remove the flag later.  The hope is that the flag doesn\u0027t live very long, but when I see flags with || and \u0026\u0026 I worry that we\u0027ll mess up the removal.\n\n```suggestion\n  if (!IS_FLAG_ENABLED(a2dp_concurrent_source_sink)) {\n    if (bluetooth::audio::a2dp::is_hal_enabled() ||\n        !btif_av_is_a2dp_offload_running()) {\n      btif_a2dp_source_on_stopped(p_av_suspend);\n    }\n  } else\n  /* Optional comment to point out that we should cut to this point */\n  if (peer_type_sep \u003d\u003d AVDT_TSEP_SNK) {\n    if (bluetooth::audio::a2dp::is_hal_enabled() ||\n        !btif_av_is_a2dp_offload_running()) {\n      btif_a2dp_source_on_stopped(p_av_suspend);\n    }\n  }\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 144,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 150,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "462b2989a79c4a997d58086305b04c0b7a796b25",
